   "translations": [
    {
     "id": 97056,
     "resource_id": 20,
     "text": "Say, \"If the sea were ink for [writing] the words<sup foot_note=196716>1</sup> of my Lord, the sea would be exhausted before the words of my Lord were exhausted, even if We brought the like of it in [continual] supplement.\""
